OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLingering
OL,6,Fheavy, perhaps thundery, showers only
OL,7,Fgradually easing off during the
OL,8,Fevening. Mostly dry during the early
OL,9,Fhours with a few clear spells. Breezy
OL,10,Fat first, this also easing. A mild
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FDry to start, perhaps with
OL,14,Fsome early sunny spells. Cloud
OL,15,Fthickening, with rain arriving late
OL,16,Fmorning, this occasionally heavy and
OL,17,Fperhaps thundery, likely clearing
OL,18,Fduring the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
